@*
    One brand prefix for every browser tab.

    The Razor Pages side already renders "<page> — Roivo" from its shared
    _Layout, but Blazor has no equivalent hook: each page writes its own
    <PageTitle>, and they had drifted — most bare, one with the brand trailing,
    three marketing pages carrying it inline. This component is the Blazor half
    of that layout rule, so the two halves of the app agree.
*@

<PageTitle>@Marketing.BrandName — @Title</PageTitle>

@code {
    /// <summary>
    /// The page's own name, already localized. The brand prefix is added here,
    /// so callers must not repeat it.
    /// </summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Title { get; set; } = "";
}
